@startuml
title Activity 01 - Login and 2FA
start
|CustomerApp|
:1. Credential intake capture;
|AuthAPI|
:2. Credential intake validate;
|NotificationService|
:3. Credential intake enrich;
|FraudEngine|
:4. Credential intake execute;
|CustomerApp|
:5. Primary authentication capture;
|AuthAPI|
:6. Primary authentication validate;
|NotificationService|
:7. Primary authentication enrich;
|FraudEngine|
:8. Primary authentication execute;
if (Primary authentication gate passed?) then (yes)
  :Continue primary authentication;
else (no)
  :Create exception and rework task;
  stop
endif
|CustomerApp|
:9. Challenge orchestration capture;
|AuthAPI|
:10. Challenge orchestration validate;
|NotificationService|
:11. Challenge orchestration enrich;
|FraudEngine|
:12. Challenge orchestration execute;
