|NotificationService|
:15. OTP verification enrich;
|FraudEngine|
:16. OTP verification execute;
if (OTP verification gate passed?) then (yes)
  :Continue otp verification;
else (no)
  :Create exception and rework task;
  stop
endif
|CustomerApp|
:17. Session establishment capture;
|AuthAPI|
:18. Session establishment validate;
|NotificationService|
:19. Session establishment enrich;
|FraudEngine|
:20. Session establishment execute;
fork
|AuthAPI|
:Persist operational state update;
:Publish domain event;
fork again
|NotificationService|
:Send downstream integration message;
:Record delivery/ack status;
fork again
|FraudEngine|
:Write audit and compliance evidence;
:Update monitoring indicators;
end fork
