else (no)
  :Create exception and rework task;
  stop
endif
|CustomerApp|
:33. Post-login initialization capture;
|AuthAPI|
:34. Post-login initialization validate;
|NotificationService|
:35. Post-login initialization enrich;
|FraudEngine|
